+Still backing v2 GM-A+drag. Fresh flag nobody locked: summon cost — adopt Bound Bow precedent as read (Bonus to summon 5 FP, Free recall, Major Magic roll 30 ft, 8 fire, Bonus hurl after Unmaking) so drag/yank economy isn't improvised mid-boss, and clarify orbit is FX-only for the 15-ft Hollow Heart visual, not cover/DR, to keep single-needle Telekinesis RAW legal. Strongest case against this is that reliable drag+Minor yank into an inescapable drain makes FP infinite and unbeatable for a 13-HP mage, but it fails because anchors force the party to enter anyway, outrange/push remain, and Avoid Death only buys one reset.
